vessel-eaglewh40k-name = Eagle-pattern Fighter
vessel-eaglewh40k-desc = A compact fighter with paired energy weapons and an auxiliary power supply for escort duty and short sorties.

vessel-lightningwh40k-name = Lightning-pattern Fighter
vessel-lightningwh40k-desc = A small combat craft carrying autocannons and missile launchers, with a dedicated gunnery station for coordinated attack runs.

vessel-sharkwh40k-name = Shark-pattern Fighter
vessel-sharkwh40k-desc = A small gunship armed with an assault cannon and quad autocannons. Its auxiliary generators support close escort and patrol work.

vessel-thunderboltwh40k-name = Thunderbolt-pattern Strike Craft
vessel-thunderboltwh40k-desc = A small strike craft with paired munitions bays and an ammunition loader, built to deliver ordnance under fighter escort.
